@ResourceManagmentsystem_HostAddress = http://localhost:5204

// conifgaratins of api end points 

POST {{ResourceManagmentsystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

###

@token = TOKEN_HERE

### Current User 
GET {{ResourceManagmentsystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization : Bare {{token}}


### Dashboard 
GET {{ResourceManagmentsystem_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Authorization : Bare {{token}}

### User Projects 
GET {{ResourceManagmentsystem_HostAddress}}/api/project
Authorization : Bare {{token}}

### Users 
GET {{ResourceManagmentsystem_HostAddress}}/api/user
Authorization : Bare {{token}}

### Log Out 
POST {{ResourceManagmentsystem_HostAddress}}/api/logout
Authorization : Bare {{token}}
